# Allowlist: only send what the image needs to the build context, so local files (secrets, data, editor state)
# can never end up in an image layer. tests/ is included because `docker compose run --rm test` runs jest in the image.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!tsconfig.json
!src/
!tests/

# Never send secrets, even if one ends up inside an allowlisted directory
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
